                                     rdfs:label "has Cockpit to Main Gear Ft" ;
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> """Aircraft Cockpit to Main Gear (CMG) Distance
In most General Aviation aircraft where the cockpit is located aft of the nose gear, CMG is equal to Wheelbase.""" .


