                obo:IAO_0000111 "requirements textual entity"@en ;
                obo:IAO_0000112 """From Qi et al. BMC Bioinformatics. 2014; 15: 11. (http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3897912/):

